#Project.
##A collage is providing a range of student support services, such as academic support, careers advice, learning support and other student services.
##Currently, students may contact services by email or by phone, while staff use calenders, spreadsheets and other informal methods to manage appointments.
##The collage wants to investigate a software system that could make appointment management easier.
##Problems currenly happening are:
##-Students are sometimes unsure which service they should contact.
##-Students may not know when appointments are available. 
##-Staff spend time managing appointments manually.
##-Cancellations and changes can be difficult to manage
##-Different staff may have different appointment types and availability 

#Stakeholders:
##-Students
##-Staff
##-Collage
##-IT Department

#Needs:
##Services for students to contact need to be clearly shown on the system.
##Whether we need to transfer the pervious appointments to the system or they wont use the system until all the previous appointments are finished is unclear.
##System should automate managing appointments so that Staff shouldent need to manage them manually.
##Staff need to be asked about their different appointment types and availability for the system.

#Goals
##Help reduce unsureness for students about services.
##Help reduce additional workload for staff.
##Make changes or cancellation easier to manage.

Scope:


Assumptions:
That all users have access to wifi.
That the collage has a plan for the transfer to the new system.
That we will be shown the contact info for the services for students.

Unknowns:
If the collage wants to transfer the appointments to the system or wait until all appoints are finished to implaemnt the new system.
if the system needs a login to access or not.
if there needs to be diffent login types for diffent users, aka staff and students.


Requirements:
The system shall display the contact info for student services.
The system shall stop the need for staff to manually ajust the appointments.
The system will protect info about students and appointments.





